Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:06.16,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Good morning, everyone! \NHow are you all doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.16,0:00:08.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm doing swimmingly, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:09.44,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Morn, morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.44,0:00:13.28,Main - Top,IKO,0,0,0,,Morn, morning! Morn, morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.85,0:00:11.09,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:13.28,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You're in great spirits so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.50,0:00:19.01,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's the matter? I said good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.01,0:00:20.35,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's yours truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:23.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.39,0:00:25.45,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Let's get ready \Nfor the morning broadcast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.45,0:00:27.32,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,About the revisions to the script...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:28.97,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Talk to me, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.97,0:00:30.38,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What was that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.38,0:00:33.97,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Don't just ignore me! \NAsk me what's bugging me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.74,0:00:37.64,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Right, sorry about that. \NDid something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.16,0:00:41.07,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm not telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.07,0:00:42.06,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's your problem?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:44.59,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I've never seen \Na hit-and-run in a convo before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.59,0:00:47.69,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Do you want to talk about it or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.94,0:00:49.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.70,0:00:51.92,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I have things to do, so I'm leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.55,0:00:58.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's her deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.12,0:01:00.14,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Gotta love it when she bleps.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:04.47,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,She joined the theater club \Nlast week as a temp helper.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.47,0:01:05.58,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The theater club?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.58,0:01:07.55,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,But it looks like it \Nhasn't been going so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.55,0:01:10.80,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,She agreed to it since it'd \Nhelp her practice her acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:14.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Huh... Knowing her, I'd think \Nshe could work with anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.97,0:01:19.87,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Oh, please. Nene-chan actually \Nshuns people she isn't close to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.87,0:01:21.55,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,She's cheery in class, though, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.55,0:01:24.44,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Nene only likes people who like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:25.69,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Really? Her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.58,0:01:28.82,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I hate all the people who hate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.08,0:01:30.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That does make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:33.38,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Can you do something \Nabout this, Yamabuki-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:37.82,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I couldn't say. Not without \Nknowing what the cause is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.39,0:01:40.70,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You can't, Bucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:43.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.88,0:01:48.04,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,How am I meant to resolve this \Nwhen she doesn't want to talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:51.91,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Besides, acting and voice acting \Naren't quite one and the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.91,0:01:55.05,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Half-baked advice would only \Nplant weird ideas in her head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:59.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, nobody can give her \Na helping hand right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:03.10,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.10,0:02:05.52,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It's me, yours truly!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:06.75,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Hook, line, and sinker!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.75,0:02:10.15,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Wow, he's so fun to egg on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.15,0:02:12.15,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}THEATER CLUB
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:12.15,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.15,0:02:15.81,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for being so pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.81,0:02:17.89,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,I was the one closest to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.89,0:02:20.95,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,and yet I couldn't give you all my love!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:24.23,Main,THEATER A,0,0,0,,Oizumi-san's been in the zone lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.23,0:02:28.64,Main,THEATER B,0,0,0,,Her dream is to become an actress \Nand marry a celebrity to get his money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.64,0:02:31.71,Main,THEATER C,0,0,0,,Huh? What happened to marrying \Nthe heir of a big corporation?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.71,0:02:35.40,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,If... If you'll forgive me—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.40,0:02:38.88,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,if you're still willing \Nto give me your love—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.88,0:02:42.48,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,won't you tell me that \Nyou love me once more?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:43.68,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Yep. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:45.02,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Wassup with that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.02,0:02:46.27,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Oizumi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:48.97,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Cut, cut. Stop the cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.97,0:02:50.25,Main,THEATER D,0,0,0,,We don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.25,0:02:51.48,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Himekawa-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:55.11,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,I told you this before. \NDid you actually read the script?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:57.41,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh? I did...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.41,0:02:59.28,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,That's not the impression I'm getting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.04,0:03:04.38,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,H-How uncharacteristically meek of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.38,0:03:05.12,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:07.57,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,This scene has a couple oh-so-in-love,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.57,0:03:10.28,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,and yet the foolish man \Nhas run to another woman
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.28,0:03:11.75,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,after a trivial disagreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.75,0:03:15.03,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,He then desperately begs for forgiveness \Nlike the pathetic loser he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.03,0:03:18.55,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,The girl has mixed feelings, but \Nshe bottles them up and forgives him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.55,0:03:21.46,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,It's a highly complex and powerful scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.46,0:03:23.81,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,And yet, this is how you acted it out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.81,0:03:25.68,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,"Yep! I wuv you!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:27.13,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,It's shallow as hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.13,0:03:28.23,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Oizumi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.23,0:03:30.27,Main,THEATER E,0,0,0,,Please stop throwing yourself \Nat the equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.27,0:03:33.38,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Too shallow! Your acting is a sham!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.38,0:03:35.34,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,A-A sham?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:36.91,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,But I put a lot of thought into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.91,0:03:38.74,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm acting for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.74,0:03:40.24,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,"Thought"? Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.24,0:03:42.31,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,You actually think when you're acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.31,0:03:43.16,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.94,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,You're not supposed to \Nthink while you act.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.94,0:03:49.75,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,When you cry or get angry, do you \Nstop to think, "Okay, time to cry"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.75,0:03:53.34,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Emotions are born of impulses, \Nnot conscious thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.67,0:03:55.13,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Is that not the case for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:57.70,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I-I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.17,0:04:00.30,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:02.83,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,You have to think to answer \Nthat question, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:07.07,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I see. I've heard of this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.07,0:04:08.94,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Let's take it from the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.94,0:04:11.81,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Get it right this time, Himekawa-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:12.90,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:18.15,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,How irritating! \NWhat exactly did I do wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.15,0:04:21.08,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,I agreed to help because \Nit'd improve my acting,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.08,0:04:24.70,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,but if I was gonna be berated like this, \NI wish I hadn't! Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:27.64,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Do I think when I'm acting? \NOf course I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:29.75,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,My brain is in overdrive!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.75,0:04:34.04,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,I just don't have anything to base it on, \Nunlike with anime and manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.04,0:04:38.26,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,How do I put on a good performance? \NHow can I portray the emotions?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.26,0:04:40.33,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Even now, I'm thinking about all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:45.22,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,...won't you tell me \Nthat you love me once more?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.22,0:04:48.77,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,I think and I think and I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.45,0:04:54.72,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Y-Yep... I love you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.23,0:04:58.03,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,The restroom's out the door \Nand to the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.03,0:04:59.85,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I-I'm not holding it in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.85,0:05:02.11,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Massage the pressure point \Nbehind your knee to wake up your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:04.61,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,M-My legs aren't asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.61,0:05:08.70,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I never expected her to be so meek \Noutside her comfort zone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:12.46,Broadcast,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Let's have another great day today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.69,0:05:21.23,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Okay, time to go back to class.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.22,0:05:32.29,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Is it just me, or is she \Ngetting grumpier by the day?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.29,0:05:35.66,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Disaster will strike our village \Nif we don't offer a sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.66,0:05:37.86,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Gah! This just pisses me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.86,0:05:39.92,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Damn that Oizumi girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.92,0:05:43.11,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,"Don't think, feel"? \NWho are you, Bruce Lee?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.11,0:05:47.08,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,"Emotions are impulses"? She's just \Nsaying random crap to boost her ego!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.08,0:05:49.30,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,None of it makes any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:55.88,Flashback Italics,NENEDAD,0,0,0,,You're such a good girl, Nene. \NYou do everything your dad wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:58.78,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Of course I think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.78,0:06:02.97,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,I was always trying to think of \Nways to make him happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.99,0:06:11.48,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Whoa, Yamabuki-kun's going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:15.15,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.15,0:06:17.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I saw what happened \Nin theater club yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:18.53,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.53,0:06:20.04,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,There's something I want to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.04,0:06:21.09,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.09,0:06:23.86,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Are you here to cheer me up or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.19,0:06:26.35,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I've been wondering...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.11,0:06:28.49,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your hair ornaments.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.99,0:06:30.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Are they an homage to stag beetles?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.33,0:06:38.79,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Did you come here just to ask me that? \NYou piss me all the way off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.79,0:06:40.72,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What the hell are you thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:44.55,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now that's impulsive, Himekawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.55,0:06:47.71,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Did you think before you got mad \Nand sent me flying just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.71,0:06:48.91,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Shaddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.17,0:06:52.31,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.31,0:06:54.23,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I was trying, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:56.19,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's the way, Himekawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.19,0:06:58.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Your raw emotions are spilling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.89,0:07:00.20,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:09.74,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,She just kept berating me! I hate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:12.20,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Excellent! This makes for great acting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:15.41,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Empty your mind and obey your instincts!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:17.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You want to get back at her? \NLet's do just that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.39,0:07:18.72,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'll give you some special training!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.72,0:07:20.42,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Over my dead body!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:22.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Good! You're showing a lot of feeling!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:25.97,Main,EPTITLEA SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FEELINGS ARE IMPULSIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.73,0:09:01.82,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,They often say to \N"get into character," but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.82,0:09:04.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I doubt you can do it for something \Nyou don't have experience with.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.65,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're not a professional \Nactress, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:09.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,So, to play the role \Nof someone who's been cheated on,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:13.45,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,you'll first need to experience \Nbeing cheated on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.45,0:09:15.47,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,On that note...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.47,0:09:17.82,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! Please forgive me \Nfor cheating on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.82,0:09:19.34,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We're not even dating!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.34,0:09:21.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The role you're playing...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:25.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,is a woman cheated on after a fight \Nby a man she was happily dating,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.88,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,and she still forgives him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:29.30,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.30,0:09:30.30,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.30,0:09:31.58,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.58,0:09:35.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Suppose a cheater professed \Nhis love for you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:38.62,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Could you actually say you \Nlove him just like in the script?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:39.58,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.58,0:09:40.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You'd think about it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.89,0:09:41.77,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:45.38,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's why experiencing it \Nis the way to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:48.94,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The impulse you feel then will \Nmake your acting authentic.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.37,0:09:50.86,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,We're doing this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:53.24,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I have to pretend to be your girlfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:56.91,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,and also have to experience \Nbeing cheated on?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.91,0:09:59.34,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Who are you going to cheat on me with?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.12,0:10:01.10,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,That'd be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.10,0:10:02.91,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wha... Why Iko?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:05.79,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's because I'm in love with Bucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.79,0:10:06.79,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.79,0:10:09.89,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Or so the story goes. \NDon't take it seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.89,0:10:11.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She just has the most free time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:15.90,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,So you and I are in love, \Nand you cheat on me with Iko?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.90,0:10:19.01,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound realistic. \NThere's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.01,0:10:23.69,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Are you going to let Oizumi get away \Nwith trash-talking you, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.65,0:10:28.38,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She'll mock you forever, \Nsaying you're all voice and go,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.38,0:10:34.06,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,"Oh, I guess all those faceless voice \Nactors just aren't that good at acting!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.78,0:10:36.24,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Don't you want revenge?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:38.86,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Don't you want to make her pay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.02,0:10:43.16,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I so wanna get back at her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:44.59,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yes! That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.59,0:10:45.87,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'll make her cry uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.87,0:10:47.83,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Great! Your feelings are exploding!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:49.81,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'll make her kneel \Nand lick my shoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.81,0:10:51.34,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.64,0:10:53.38,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Let's begin our special training, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.38,0:10:55.82,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,We'll take this somewhere more suitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.82,0:10:56.82,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.14,0:10:59.76,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:02.14,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:03.64,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:08.54,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I've always been a pain to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.54,0:11:09.84,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I don't mind at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.23,0:11:12.78,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,A girl who's a handful has her own charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.25,0:11:24.83,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,The heck was that? Buzz off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:29.33,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}Furin High School
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.91,0:11:29.33,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,There you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.66,0:11:33.13,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Me and Ki... Iko have been \Ngoing out in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.13,0:11:35.64,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But you're my one true love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:36.97,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.97,0:11:39.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Will you give me one more chance?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:43.94,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The bathroom is over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.94,0:11:46.06,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Ugh! I knew you'd say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.37,0:11:49.36,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Sorry, it just doesn't feel real to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:52.40,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I can't imagine Iko going out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:54.28,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You're the love of my life, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.28,0:11:56.18,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Till death do us part.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:11:58.16,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,This is fake as hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.16,0:12:01.85,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I suppose it'll take a while. \NTake your time and get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:03.21,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Are we done for today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:06.60,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yeah. Iko and I will go \Nfinish up some club tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.72,0:12:11.71,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,I just don't see this working out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.71,0:12:15.13,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Iko and him dating? \NI simply can't picture it...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.13,0:12:16.68,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,one bit...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.70,0:12:21.33,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,I guess it's not totally impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.33,0:12:22.35,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.35,0:12:25.52,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm kinda curious what it feels like
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.52,0:12:28.73,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,to have someone you love stolen from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.51,0:12:35.78,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Say, Arisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:39.40,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,How long will we have to \Nhide our relationship?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.40,0:12:42.99,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Just bear with it. If anyone \Nfound out we were dating,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.99,0:12:44.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,it'd be a major headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.53,0:12:47.35,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I really wanna have you all to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:49.28,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,but that's asking too much, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.28,0:12:53.70,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Still, isn't it fun to pretend \Nthat we're acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.07,0:12:57.07,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I guess, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.07,0:12:59.93,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,Are those two really... What? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.93,0:13:03.05,Italics,NENE,0,0,0,,No way! No freaking way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:06.12,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's looking at us \Nand her eyes are popped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:09.25,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Stop! Don't look! You'll give it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.25,0:13:12.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is this prank really going to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.96,0:13:15.94,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,C'mon, Shinobu and Rikka said so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.55,0:13:18.07,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:21.28,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,You want Nene-chan \Nto experience being cheated on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.28,0:13:22.03,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.43,0:13:24.74,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,All you need to do is get a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.74,0:13:26.41,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,You make it sound so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.67,0:13:28.25,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,I mean a fake one, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.50,0:13:31.62,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,If she sees you get lovey-dovey \Nwith another girl in secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:34.09,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,it'll be a big shock for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:35.46,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.77,0:13:39.13,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Won't this plan fall apart \Nif she doesn't like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:42.22,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,And what if she doesn't have \N{\i1}any{\i0} positive feelings for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.65,0:13:45.39,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,Get over yourself, you dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.39,0:13:46.97,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.44,0:13:49.49,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Things got awkward between us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:53.23,Flashback,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I think she likes you \Nwell enough, Yamabuki-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:56.88,Flashback,RIKKA,0,0,0,,If she really hated you, \Nyou'd have been kicked out long ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.88,0:13:57.97,Flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,Yep, yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.97,0:13:59.75,Flashback,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:02.07,Flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,So, who's gonna be the girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:04.18,Flashback,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Let's decide with rock-paper-scissors.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.74,0:14:06.86,Flashback,ALL,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.43,0:14:10.39,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,The prank does seem \Nto have worked, but now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.72,0:14:15.33,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Uh, isn't Nene-chan more distraught \Nthan we thought she'd be?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.33,0:14:17.79,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,She's frozen stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:19.75,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Even if it's not exactly cheating,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:25.76,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,I figured she'd be taken aback to see \Na guy she's close to dating her friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:27.85,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,But she's way more than taken aback.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.85,0:14:31.43,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Heck, those two froze up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.43,0:14:35.68,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Well, they expected Nene-chan \Nto jump in to stop them,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.68,0:14:37.90,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,so they probably have \Nno idea what to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.90,0:14:41.15,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,This is a problem. \NThere's nothing for us to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.42,0:14:43.82,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Himekawa's still frozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:46.39,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Maybe we should start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.75,0:14:48.74,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:52.70,Flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,So, have you ever kissed anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:56.09,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,I have, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.09,0:14:59.00,Flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,Really? Who? And when?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:01.45,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,It was fairly recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.95,0:15:05.97,Flashback,IKO,0,0,0,,Do you have feelings for Bucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.24,0:15:10.48,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,Not really. I hate all boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:13.14,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,But... well,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:16.50,Flashback,NENE,0,0,0,,he's better than the other \Nboys I know, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.06,0:15:22.37,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Nene was being cagey back then,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.37,0:15:24.40,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,but I guess I'll be upfront about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.40,0:15:25.40,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.56,0:15:32.33,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I want to kiss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:33.12,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.12,0:15:34.00,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:37.96,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I like you, Arisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:40.96,Main,EPTITLEB SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}FEELINGS CAN ESCALATE
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:43.96,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I want to kiss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:48.40,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I like you, Arisu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:52.93,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I see how it is. Good call, Kirino.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:58.01,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Couples kiss. This will \Nmake us look more convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.01,0:16:00.73,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Now Himekawa will have \Nno choice but to step in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.99,0:16:07.17,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Well, I'm still not convinced \Nthat doing this will make her jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.17,0:16:10.29,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,But yours truly is pretty good \Nwith fake kisses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.29,0:16:14.24,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,I was always the prince \Nin preschool plays, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:17.43,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Isn't she getting too close, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.43,0:16:19.80,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Is she really going to stop in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.80,0:16:21.63,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Wait, is she actually going to kiss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.63,0:16:24.72,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,She's getting a bit too into the role!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.34,0:16:29.11,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hold it, Kirino!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:30.71,Italics,ARISU,0,0,0,,Are you seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.10,0:16:37.27,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.27,0:16:41.19,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you two thinking? \NWe're at school, you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.19,0:16:44.11,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hell, you shouldn't be doing \Nthis outside school, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.11,0:16:47.35,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,This is neither the time, \Nthe place, nor the occasion!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.35,0:16:49.00,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Calm down, Nene-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.00,0:16:51.28,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Sorry. They were just acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.28,0:16:53.37,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,Let us explain from the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.32,0:16:56.75,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,And that's the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.07,0:16:59.25,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Sorry for tricking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.25,0:17:01.64,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,But it wouldn't have seemed as real \Nif we hadn't done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.64,0:17:03.75,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'm not mad or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.75,0:17:06.76,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Well? Was this experience \Nhelpful for your acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.19,0:17:09.74,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Hell if I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:14.44,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Ack, is she actually mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.44,0:17:17.05,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,It'll be fine... I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:20.02,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,We should calm her down some.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.02,0:17:21.44,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Nene-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.44,0:17:24.17,Main,RIKKA,0,0,0,,This whole thing was Shinobu's idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.17,0:17:26.26,Main,SHINOBU,0,0,0,,Hey, Rikka-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:29.07,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You really came through, Kirino.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:31.74,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I had no idea what to do back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.74,0:17:36.53,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I didn't think you'd pretend to kiss me. \NIt made us look like a real couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.58,0:17:40.50,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Right? My ad lib saved \Nyour skin back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:43.98,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,For a second, I panicked
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.98,0:17:46.28,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,because I thought you \Nmight really kiss me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.79,0:17:48.67,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.05,0:17:52.07,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Have you ever kissed Nene, Bucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.07,0:17:54.73,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Come on, now. Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.43,0:17:57.93,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Here. It's not much, but thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.93,0:17:59.31,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,You haven't?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.31,0:18:01.42,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Did she tell you otherwise?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.42,0:18:02.52,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.52,0:18:04.65,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Then why would you ask me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:09.23,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.23,0:18:10.76,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I want your drink instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:12.74,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I already took a sip from it, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.74,0:18:13.54,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.54,0:18:15.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,If you say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.60,0:18:21.27,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,I'll make do with this for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.06,0:18:24.75,Main,IKO,0,0,0,,Bitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:26.80,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I knew you couldn't handle coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:32.84,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}THEATER CLUB
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:32.84,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:35.93,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Please forgive me for being so pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:37.34,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,I admit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.34,0:18:40.32,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,I am a complete and utter fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.32,0:18:45.14,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,It has taken me this long to realize \Nhow important you are to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:49.36,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,My rose only blooms in splendor
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.61,0:18:53.89,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,because I have you, my sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.28,0:18:56.65,Main,THEATER A,0,0,0,,Is it me, or is her acting \Ngetting more showy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.65,0:18:59.74,Main,THEATER B,0,0,0,,I'm impressed Himekawa-san \Nactually came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.74,0:19:02.13,Main,THEATER C,0,0,0,,After getting that flak, too! \NShe has guts!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.13,0:19:03.16,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,If...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:05.54,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,If you'll forgive me—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.54,0:19:08.54,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,if you're still willing \Nto give me your love—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.90,0:19:12.48,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,won't you tell me \Nthat you love me once more?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:27.47,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I don't want to see your \Nstupid mug ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.47,0:19:28.56,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Get out of my sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.93,0:19:33.40,Main,THEATER D,0,0,0,,Time out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.40,0:19:35.70,Main,THEATER D,0,0,0,,Himekawa-san, that's not the right line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.70,0:19:36.90,Main,THEATER D,0,0,0,,And you're way too scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:40.54,Main,THEATER D,0,0,0,,You're supposed to forgive \Nthe protagonist there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.54,0:19:42.45,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,No, that was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.45,0:19:43.82,Main,THEATER D,0,0,0,,Oizumi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:49.08,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Your expression and line \Ndelivery were excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:52.74,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,It felt real, like you'd \Nactually been cheated on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.74,0:19:56.88,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Your emotions truly shone through!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.88,0:19:59.48,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,Did someone cheat on you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.85,0:20:02.84,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Something like that, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.84,0:20:07.07,Main,SEIRA,0,0,0,,What, really? Tell me more!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.07,0:20:09.66,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,What more do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.72,0:20:14.36,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I got my payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.36,0:20:15.21,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Praise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.21,0:20:18.30,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Yeah, I saw. You were amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:21.41,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,It's embarrassing when \Nyou're so direct about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.41,0:20:23.73,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You're getting along \Nwith the members, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.73,0:20:27.33,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Yeah. I've learned to be \Nmore open with my feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.33,0:20:30.32,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,and speak my mind whenever I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.32,0:20:31.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That's good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.50,0:20:37.01,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,You might've played a part.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:39.01,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.44,0:20:42.98,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Now I kinda get it when \Nthey say emotions are impulsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.98,0:20:46.83,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,They slip out even when \Nyou try to bottle them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.83,0:20:49.24,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I'd love to use that in my acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:52.61,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,You've actually shown some growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.61,0:20:54.92,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Putting on an act with Iko was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:57.94,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Still... The kiss was going too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.82,0:20:57.94,Main,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}NO ENTRY
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.94,0:20:59.23,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.23,0:21:01.52,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,That was Kirino's ad lib.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.52,0:21:04.96,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,I expected you to butt in much earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.96,0:21:06.33,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.12,0:21:08.20,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:11.69,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,If I hadn't stopped you, \Nwould you two have actually kissed?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.55,0:21:17.68,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Kirino and all you teenage girls \Nsure love to talk about this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.68,0:21:20.51,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,It was all an act. \NThere's no way we'd do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.51,0:21:21.84,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.42,0:21:32.44,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Iko might've been serious, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:34.31,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.29,0:21:37.19,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,If it were me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.19,0:21:39.98,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I might've kept going and kissed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:40.74,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:44.58,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,N-Nothing! I'm outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.58,0:21:45.37,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.37,0:21:46.99,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,This is your fault, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.99,0:21:49.98,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Now I'm saying whatever pops into my head!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.98,0:21:52.01,Main,ARISU,0,0,0,,How is that my...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.24,0:21:57.52,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.52,0:21:59.59,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,That must've looked \Npretty impulsive, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.04,0:22:02.47,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I needed to get some \Npayback for that prank.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.47,0:22:05.30,Main,NENE,0,0,0,,I guess I've gotten better at acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.93,0:22:09.93,Main,EPTITLEC SIGN,0,0,0,,{\an8}PAYBACK ACHIEVED
